  TITLE     BAP1 loss defines a new class of renal cell carcinoma
  JOURNAL   Nat. Genet. 44 (7), 751-759 (2012)
   PUBMED   22683710
  REMARK    GeneRIF: BAP1 loss sensitizes RCC cells in vitro to genotoxic
            stress.
            Erratum:[Nat Genet. 2012 Sep;44(9):1072]
REFERENCE   5  (bases 1 to 3717)
  AUTHORS   Eletr ZM and Wilkinson KD.
  TITLE     An emerging model for BAP1's role in regulating cell cycle
            progression
  JOURNAL   Cell Biochem. Biophys. 60 (1-2), 3-11 (2011)
   PUBMED   21484256
  REMARK    GeneRIF: Studies suggest that BAP1 influences cell proliferation at
            G1/S by co-regulating transcription from HCF-1/E2F-governed
            promoters.
            Review article
