REFERENCE   10 (bases 1 to 3717)
  AUTHORS   Pilarski,R., Rai,K., Cebulla,C. and Abdel-Rahman,M.
  TITLE     BAP1 Tumor Predisposition Syndrome
  JOURNAL   (in) Adam MP, Ardinger HH, Pagon RA, Wallace SE, Bean LJH, Stephens
            K and Amemiya A (Eds.);
            GENEREVIEWS((R));
